         <title>Masters of PixInsight V8 Scripts v1.5.14</title>
         <description>
            <p>v1.5.14 — Remove AutoCrop Views: the ACR masters it saves now keep the
            astrometric solution, so RGB images combined from them work with
            SpectrophotometricColorCalibration. Identifiers stay abbreviated
            (integration_R/G/B/L) and filenames keep the full filter name.
            36 scripts total.</p>
         </description>
      </package>
   </platform>
